  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Ports Authority - assessment on green shipping and green port policy initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to do an assessment on green shipping and green port policy initiatives with Kenya Ports Authority. Concretely, the project supports Kenya Ports Authority in assessing ways that the Mombasa port can integrate green initiatives and make an implementation plan to transition to a fully green port through TradeMark Africa for the Mombasa and Kisumu port initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
